  <data key="d6">normal_onset_dry_spell</data>
  <data key="d1">Normal onset followed by a 15-20 day dry spell after sowing</data>
  <data key="d5">Early season drought (delayed onset)</data>
  <data key="d19">15</data>
  <data key="d20">20</data>
  <data key="d21">30</data>
  <data key="d18">Normal onset followed by 15- 20 days dry spell after sowing leading to poor germination/crop stand etc. || Normal onset followed by 15-20 days dry spell after sowing germination / crop stand etc. || Normal onset followed by 15-20 days dry spell after sowing leading to poor germination / crop stand etc.</data>
</node>
<node id="Action:action_51b7d6d96a">
  <data key="d0">Action</data>
  <data key="d6">action_51b7d6d96a</data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">• Gap filling within the rows with same cultivar or pigeonpea to maintain at least 75% plant population. • Raise cotton seedlings in polythene bags and transplant when sufficient soil moisture is available. • Give protective irrigation wherever possible</data>
  <data key="d11">• Avoid applying fertilizers till sufficient soil. moisture is available • Interculture with harrow/hoe</data>
  <data key="d12"></data>
  <data key="d13">MAIDC for implements. • Linkage with MAU, KVK for agro techniques</data>
  <data key="d14">irrigation</data>
  <data key="d15">irrigation;moisture_conservation;nutrient_management;thinning_or_resowing;input_supply_linkage</data>
</node>
