  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">• Apply foliar spray of streptocycline sulphate @ 6g/60 litre + COC @ 25g/10 litre to prevent bacterial leaf blight • Apply Sulphur 25g/10 litre (300 mesh) to prevent grey mildew • Apply MgSO4 25 kg/ha soil application or 1% MgSO4 foliar spray to prevent leaf reddening</data>
