  <data key="d10">i) Mealy bug – - Use of sticky traps on trunks and girdles - Spraying of methyl dematon / malathion 15-20 ml / 10 lit. a) Disease – i) Anthracnose – Spraying of carbendazim 50 WP 0.1 % ii) Powdery mildew - Spraying of wettable sulfur 80 WP 0.2 % or penconazole 0.05 % iii) Downy mildew – Spraying of Bordeaux mixture 0.4 to 1.0 % or metalaxyl mancozeb 0.2 % or cymoxanil mancozeb 0.2 %</data>
