  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">Insect pest : Pod borer: Chlorpyriphos 20 % 2 ml of water Diseases: Rust – • Early sowing in last week of may • Use of disease resistant variety (DS-228) • Spraying the crop with Propiconazole @ 0.1%</data>
  <data key="d11"></data>
  <data key="d12"></data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
  <data key="d14">plant_protection</data>
