  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">Insect: Mealy bug: Use sticky traps on trunk and girdle. Spray Malathion 50 EC @ 2 ml / L Verticylum lecani 25 g /10 L of water</data>
