  <data key="d8"></data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">Insect: Short hole borer : 400 g Geru + 2.5 ml lindane (20 EC) + 2.5 g COC mix together and paste should be applied to branches</data>
  <data key="d11"></data>
