  <data key="d10">Diseases-Powdery mildew- Spray wettable sulphur 80 WP 0.2 % or dust 300 mesh sulphur @ 20 kg/ha. Insect Pests-Hoppers: 50 % carbaryl spray @ 2 g/L or 10 % carbaryl dust @ 20 kg /ha</data>
  <data key="d11"></data>
  <data key="d12"></data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
